            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Cone Player 0.2.2</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Updates now have their own page in Settings.</strong> Open Settings › Updates to see your version, turn automatic checks on or off, and choose <em>Check for Updates…</em>.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
