            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Cone Player 0.2.1</h2>
<ul>
  <li>The app menu now reads <em>Cone Player</em> instead of <em>ConePlayer</em>.</li>
  <li>This is also the first update delivered in-app, so it confirms updates work end to end.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
