            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Cone Player 0.2.0</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>In-app updates.</strong> Cone Player now checks for new versions once a day and asks before installing. You can also choose <em>Cone Player › Check for Updates…</em>, and turn automatic checks off in Settings › Interface › Updates.</li>
  <li>The source code is now public on GitHub.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
